  "label": "User projected onto the visual metaphor of camels shouting to mock 'logic'",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the three camels with open mouths, which serves as a visual metaphor for mocking the 'logic' presented in the text. The camels' posture and expression are used to represent the absurdity or ridicule of the claim, creating a shared experience of laughter or disbelief that the user is invited to participate in. This projection is implicit, as the meme relies on the viewer to interpret the camels' visual pun as a direct commentary on the text's content, making the user an active participant in the meme's satirical framing.",
